", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5-rShwIxXsQ7kNvwFfRq49&_nc_oc=Ador4YDiSwvku6nQBQ0TpVMdGQWHrtY89Oh-9pfFmtaa962Fpcg9_BWBPWj8BmFUqCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5M34M8SGRKR3MKp_GyeEdAvrUwhiIfm_j83r6V-Z1Xcw&oe=6A0B1679"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yaGj9-ZzSDAQ7kNvwFtardu&_nc_oc=AdrPTJP_jbXQ_-ororhH8sk5qQ-4fmXDaQimaFMM37RSb-ztCd2VCz7mOjfIk7LkrP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5goFFJhatYCCE9yaQ8dHvzPw0DjjT9wsfV7DMkUU8nLA&oe=6A0B2D4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9RbLN_VrbK8Q7kNvwF51UnS&_nc_oc=AdpdJvwVgBhC4f-4waZ14CY4oI7pfoW3881l89ONkWLPXPTUQqY2uMj-ciJk87Au4yk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af68KiMB5mC66oLknts_M7q4KierZk36B-eqQImH-Hzw_Q&oe=6A0B2BCE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel